{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106260","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910626001:1":{"text":"저는 이곳의 연못지기, 잔입니다.","source_cn":"我是这里的守池人，湛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FA7E639FBA88551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910626002:1":{"text":"너무 오래 쓰지 않아서 잊어버릴 지경이 된 이름이니 편한 대로 부르십시오.","source_cn":"可以随便称呼我，这个名字太久没用，我自己都快忘了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C63C2EB769917B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910626003:1":{"text":"你们是今年最后一批，去镌刻心愿吧，愿望不论早晚。","source_cn":"你们是今年最后一批，去镌刻心愿吧，愿望不论早晚。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x33BF1519907C2896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910626004:1":{"text":"아직... 살아 있다니. 믿기지 않는군.","source_cn":"你……你还在，不可思议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA638DB4F982C8008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1910626004":{"text":"아직... 살아 있다니. 믿기지 않는군.","source_cn":"你……你还在，不可思议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA638DB4F982C8008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910626005:1":{"text":"밀물과 썰물은 흔적 없이 오가지만, 암초는 영원히 그 자리를 지키며 소원은 오래도록 남지요.","source_cn":"潮升潮落，来去无痕；礁岩永伫，心愿长存。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CDC89AC030149F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910626006:1":{"text":"회유기가 시작되면 심해족들은 싸움을 멈추고 차례대로 이곳의 비석에 흔적을 남긴다. 여기는 심해에서 유일한 평화 구역이자 모든 일족이 함께 인정하는 전통이 있는 곳이지.","source_cn":"洄游季开始后，深海族裔之间会彼此休战，轮流在这里的石刻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB9FAFF61F67A8F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910626007:1":{"text":"갓 태어난 아이에게 거는 기대나, 사라져 갈지도 모르는 생명을 향한 기원... 그런 것들이다.","source_cn":"对新生儿的期待，对可能消逝的生命的祝愿……诸如此类。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54AF9CFEB2FA3E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910626008:1":{"text":"그럼 여기는... 심해족들이 소원을 비는 곳이야? 너랑 가네트도?","source_cn":"所以这是……你们各自留下愿望的地方？所有深海族裔，包括...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8099D88EB0A8FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910626009:1":{"text":"네.","source_cn":"对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAAE344DA30C35B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"소원을 새긴다고?","source_cn":"镌刻心愿？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x111CEC43F722C6AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"소원을 새긴다고?","female":"소원을 새긴다고?","variant_male_record_index":"96018","variant_female_record_index":"96019","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910626010:1":{"text":"저기, 이름 모를 아저씨, 나는 타라사의 천해족이야. 이 두 사람은 육지에서 왔지만 우리 해월 가문의 일원이고!","source_cn":"不知名的先生，我是出身塔拉萨的浅海裔，这两位来自陆地，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E086DB4D8BBFCB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910626011:1":{"text":"겉모습은 서로 다르더라도 본질까지 다르리란 법은 없지요. 저들이 육지에서 왔지만 얕은 바다에 속하게 된 것처럼, 당신 역시 얕은 바다에서 왔지만 심해에 속할 수도 있습니다.","source_cn":"你们的外表并不相像，但内里未必不同。他们来自陆地，却属...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59D5C6AF8B5CAFA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910626012:1":{"text":"嗯……是吗？好像有道理，但又好像没道理。我不想做深岩家的人，但是卡律先生愿不愿意加入海月家呢？这样歌尼特也能和小汐儿一起玩了！","source_cn":"嗯……是吗？好像有道理，但又好像没道理。我不想做深岩家...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x2DD4087AE49D2820","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910626013:1":{"text":"그건 아닙니다.","source_cn":"不想。","status":"matched_cn_aligned_index","hash_xxh64":"0x571BE0B44E5FBB8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910626014:1":{"text":"으... 아쉽네!","source_cn":"噢……真可惜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x542FD10745C64B6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"深岩家的新生儿？我们？","source_cn":"深岩家的新生儿？我们？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA8DAAFBE7F0892E4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"96020","variant_female_record_index":"96021","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910626015:1":{"text":"여기까지 오는 동안 멀쩡하게 말하는 사람을 한 명도 못 봤는데! 넌 어떻게 괜찮은 거야?!","source_cn":"咱一路过来没见到一个能正常说话的人，你怎么没事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84B55F2684B18459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910626016:1":{"text":"이곳에는 <style=\"highlight\">오직 한 가지만 담을 수 있기 때문이지요</style>.","source_cn":"因为这里<style=highlight>只装得下一件...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BBCDE7A816393C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910626017:1":{"text":"心愿潮池只有愿望存在，一代人的愿望，数代人的愿望。每天维护潮池，擦拭碑文，修缮被海浪侵蚀的心愿，做这些的时候，我什么也听不见。","source_cn":"心愿潮池只有愿望存在，一代人的愿望，数代人的愿望。每天...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8A8A4FFBB8E226","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910626018:1":{"text":"소원은 누군가가 이 세상에 존재했다는 증거입니다. 제가 소원들을 지키고 있으니, 어쩌면 소원들도 저를 지켜 주는 것일지 모르지요. 다만 안타깝게도, 이곳에 새로운 소원이 흘러 들어온 지도 아주 오래되었군요.","source_cn":"心愿是人存在过的证明，我保护它们，也许它们也保护我。只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA2C0AC987FC165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910626019:1":{"text":"그래서 이성을 유지할 수 있었던 건가?","source_cn":"所以你能保持理智？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99130744B3B4537","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910626020:1":{"text":"북소리는 지금도 계속 울리고 있고 저에게도 들립니다만, 귀 기울이지 않기로 했을 뿐이지요.","source_cn":"鼓声正在持续，我听得到。我只是选择不去听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEF89CC04288BD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:2:3":{"text":"아직도 이성을 유지하고 있어?!","source_cn":"你还保持着理智？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x43D7682D15418F9D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아직도 이성을 유지하고 있어?!","female":"아직도 이성을 유지하고 있어?!","variant_male_record_index":"96022","variant_female_record_index":"96023","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910626021:1":{"text":"그레이브본이 무엇인지는 모르겠지만, 천해족을 본 적은 있습니다.","source_cn":"我不知道什么是亡灵，但见过一个浅海裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77D432C16F335642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910626022:1":{"text":"이곳에 여러 번 찾아왔었습니다. 소원을 새기려 하기에 들어오도록 허락했지요.","source_cn":"他来过这里，许多次。他径直游来，想留刻心愿，于是我放他通行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E7757DDCDF47F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910626023:1":{"text":"누군지도 모르면서 왜 도와준 거야?!","source_cn":"你不认识他，干嘛帮他？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42578D673139D3D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910626024:1":{"text":"모든 소원이 모이는 곳은 그 누구도 거절하지 않으니까요.","source_cn":"此处是愿望齐聚之地，没人应被拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA792D3086C46B556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910626025:1":{"text":"여기 각인된 걸 살펴봐도 될까?","source_cn":"先生，我们可以看看这里的刻印吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F35A6C7D6AD4C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910626026:1":{"text":"얼마든지요. 여러분도 소원을 새기고 가면 좋겠군요.","source_cn":"请便，也欢迎刻录你们自己的心愿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC61F5B56549732D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document